{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2025/06/08/most-apps-all-look-the.html","date":1749416236000,"content":"<p>Most apps all look the same and have been stripped of any and all whimsy. There are exceptions. <a href=\"https://www.meetcarrot.com/weather/\">Carrot Weather</a> is one such example. <a href=\"https://notbor.ing/product/camera\">!Camera</a> is such a wonderful camera app. Been playing with it the last few days.</p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2025/e8f2a2c122.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"531\" />","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"da3b1e547baa1db122e432b421e1456608438e37952e578b22f8ac4b1d641a7c","category":"Sites"}